---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import { links } from "../config";
---

<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Coming soon · free and open source</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Android emulators for the Mac, rooted in one click.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Jidr creates and runs virtual Android phones and tablets on Apple Silicon. Pick
      <strong>Full root</strong> when you create a device, and about a minute later it shows a
      verified Magisk root. Every button is also a CLI command and an MCP tool, so scripts and AI
      agents can drive it too.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href={links.repo}><Icon name="star" />Star on GitHub</a>
      <a class="button" href={links.sponsors}><Icon name="heart" />Sponsor</a>
    </div>
    <p class="note">macOS on Apple Silicon first. Linux and Windows later.</p>
  </div>

  <figure class="terminal" aria-label="Preview of the Jidr command line">
    <div class="terminal-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> jidr device create "Pixel-ish 6.1" --api 35 --root magisk --wait-boot
<span class="dim">Downloading Magisk 30.7 · checksum verified</span>
<span class="dim">Patching a private copy of the ramdisk</span>
<span class="dim">Cold booting · installing Magisk · rebooting</span>
<span class="ok">Rooted ✓</span> Pixel-ish 6.1 · Android 15 · Magisk 30.7 · verified
<span class="prompt">$</span> adb -s emulator-5556 shell su -c id
uid=0(root) gid=0(root)</code></pre>
    <figcaption>Planned CLI. Jidr is in development.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--jidr-space-12);
    padding-block: var(--jidr-space-16) var(--jidr-space-24);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }
  h1 {
    margin-top: var(--jidr-space-3);
    font-size: var(--jidr-text-hero);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .lede {
    margin-top: var(--jidr-space-6);
    max-width: 36rem;
    font-size: var(--jidr-text-lede);
    color: var(--jidr-color-text-secondary);
  }
  .lede strong {
    color: var(--jidr-color-text-primary);
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--jidr-space-3);
    margin-top: var(--jidr-space-8);
  }
  .note {
    margin-top: var(--jidr-space-4);
    font-size: var(--jidr-text-caption);
    color: var(--jidr-color-text-tertiary);
  }
  .terminal {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
    border: var(--jidr-border-width) solid var(--jidr-color-border-default);
    border-radius: var(--jidr-radius-lg);
    background: var(--jidr-color-surface-sunken);
    box-shadow: var(--jidr-shadow-raised);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .terminal-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: var(--jidr-space-3) var(--jidr-space-4);
    border-bottom: var(--jidr-border-width) solid var(--jidr-color-border-subtle);
  }
  .terminal-bar span {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--jidr-color-border-default);
  }
  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--jidr-space-4);
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    font-size: var(--jidr-text-caption);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--jidr-color-text-code);
  }
  .prompt {
    color: var(--jidr-color-accent);
  }
  .dim {
    color: var(--jidr-color-text-tertiary);
  }
  .ok {
    color: var(--jidr-color-positive);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  figcaption {
    padding: 0 var(--jidr-space-4) var(--jidr-space-3);
    font-family: var(--jidr-font-ui);
    font-size: var(--jidr-text-caption);
    color: var(--jidr-color-text-tertiary);
  }
</style>
